+- **Output:** A compressed representation consisting of:
+  - Exact values for $\mu_i$ and $n_i$ [S2].
+  - Indices into shared codebooks for $s_i$, $\alpha_i$, and $c_i$ [S2][S3, unofficial].
+  - The shared codebooks themselves [S2].
 
